WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Today we discuss informed consent in clinical trials.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Autonomy requires that patients understand risks and alternatives.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Institutional review boards evaluate protocols before enrollment.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Beneficence and non-maleficence frame ethical trade-offs.
